        "content": "<p>fitzgen opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14705\">PR #14705</a> from <code>fitzgen:bench-api-updates</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>See each commit for details.</p>\n</blockquote>",
